# Game Master Agents

**OPENAI_API_KEY is critical.** When it is missing or not loaded in the backend environment, all agents (Sage, Shaman, Architect, etc.) fall back to deterministic templates. You get generic routing hints instead of real synthesis. For full AI behavior — sage_consult synthesis, strand multi-agent output, sage:brief insights — `OPENAI_API_KEY` must be set in `.env.local` (or the backend's env). Run `npm run smoke` to verify. See `docs/AGENT_WORKFLOWS.md` and `docs/ENV_AND_VERCEL.md`.

The six Game Master faces are: **shaman**, **regent**, **challenger**, **architect**, **diplomat**, **sage**.

**Sage = integration agent** — synthesis, meta, coordination, cross-cutting. For integration work, use `mcp_task` with subagent_type `evaluator`, or `read_rows` on council-board when the answer is already a stored record.

## MCP: council-board is the only mounted server

`bars-agents` (local Python, `backend/app/mcp_server.py`) is **archived as a mount**. Cursor no longer launches it. Its tools — `sage_consult`, `challenger_propose`, `shaman_read`, `architect_draft`, `regent_assess`, `diplomat_guide`, `diplomat_bridge`, `architect_compile` — are **not callable from the editor**. The backend agents still run inside the app; they are no longer an editor surface. `npm run verify:bars-agents-mcp`, `scripts/verify-bars-agents-mcp.ts`, and `scripts/mcp-serve-with-backend.ts` remain in the repo unmaintained.

`.cursor/mcp.json` mounts **council-board**: `https://bars-engine.vercel.app/api/mcp`, bearer `COUNCIL_MENU_TOKEN` read from the environment Cursor inherits. Tools: `read_rows`, `post_board_docs`, `write_board_rows`.

Before calling any move-shaped tool, read the store record `engine-usage-for-environments` — board `council`, collection `records`. It holds the fifteen canonical positions and the refusal rules. A move that is not in the record is not legal, and the server refuses it loudly rather than accepting a near-miss.

If the server does not appear in Cursor: confirm `COUNCIL_MENU_TOKEN` is exported in the environment Cursor inherits, then **Reload Window**.

## Faces without the server

When council-board is unreachable, do not invent a face's verdict. Use the subagent mapping below and label the output as a subagent read, not a face call.

| Face | Cursor subagent |
|------|-----------------|
| shaman | explore |
| regent | evaluator |
| challenger | contrarian |
| architect | generalPurpose |
| diplomat | simplifier |
| sage | evaluator |
